# Pinned leanSpec checkout (`make spec-pq-devnet4`). It sits at the repository
# root so the tree on disk states which devnet generation it is, which puts it
# outside every other ignore rule here — this entry is the only thing keeping a
# whole spec tree out of `git add -A`. Derived and disposable;
# `make spec-pq-devnet4-clean` removes it.
/leanSpec-pq-devnet-4/

# Conformance evidence bundles produced alongside the checkout. Derived and
# disposable — `make spec-pq-devnet4-clean` removes this too.
.audit/

# Third-party research sources (not part of this project)
superpowers-main/
caveman/

